// =====================================================================
// HUD, after Alien Swarm's own (asw_hud_master and the rest of its HUD code). Positions are its
// scripts/HudLayout.res times 2.5 (tools/hudlayout.py, written here as AS_HUD_*), the art is
// tools/hudart.py's (Derelict\UI\*.dds):
//   bottom left     the marine: the weapon in hand (white) and the last one (blue) above; the round
//                   portrait in its 270-degree health ring with the class medallion; weapon name,
//                   bullets in the clip, rifle grenades, clips left, LOW AMMO / NO AMMO; the sentry,
//                   medkit and flare with their keys and counts; the reload bar while reloading
//   along the bottom  the rest of the squad: name, class, health, ammo, clips, medkits
//   top left        the objectives, shown when they change (TAB keeps them up), "Objective complete!"
//   bottom centre   the use panel: overrides, countdowns, the medkit when infested
//   bottom right    the minimap: the level from above, the squad, aliens and the objective
//   under each marine  name and health bar
//   centre          announcements and notices, the third-person crosshair; the debrief and H help
// Dialogs are per player and shown only to that player.
// =====================================================================

const string AS_WHITE = "Derelict\\UI\\white.dds";
const string AS_VIGNETTE = "Derelict\\UI\\vignette.dds";
const string AS_UI = "Derelict\\UI\\";

